with the Hidden Brain audience about a missed opportunity that keeps you awake at night? If you'd like to share your story or a question or a comment about this episode, please find a very quiet room and record a voice memo on your phone. Two or three minutes is plenty. Email the file to us at Feedback at HiddenBrain.org using the subject line, Enemies of Happiness. Again, that's Feedback at Hiddenbrain.org.

