feelings? Has it raised questions for you about the scientific research on emotion? If you have questions for George Lowenstein or a personal story you would be willing to share with the Hidden Brain audience, please find a very quiet room and record a voice memo on your phone. Two or three minutes is plenty. Then email the file to us at Feedback at Hiddenbrain.org. Use the subject line, Enemies of Happiness.

